  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a014e981164b34ef4b183cb579b7e688, type: 3}
  m_Name: 04_OfficeMargin
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TheLightenRoad.Codex::TheLightenRoad.Codex.ArchiveLog
  Id: office-margin
  Title: A Note Above the Dust
  Location: CORPORATE OFFICE / UPPER FILES
  Text: 'Most of the cabinets are empty. Above the dust line, one folder has survived.


    Its
    margins are filled with small observations: the sound of a door settling, the
    shape of a gap, the route back to a familiar lamp. Whoever wrote this learned
    the office by the pieces the darkness could not hide.'
  RoomClue: Scout the landing before jumping down. Recovered records remain available
    after a chamber reset.
  Audio: {fileID: 0}
